  Lady Sakurako seems disarmed by the praise. It is true that there are many highborn women in this castle, most of whom live in idle luxury. They doubtless have much finer clothing than hers.

  But that is not what Ichijo meant.

pt:
//　いくらかの羞恥を滲ませて、姫が小さく応える。
